        "title": "Building a brand with no blueprint",
        "body": [
          {
            "text": "This had, to our knowledge, never been done before. Building an advertising brand from scratch centered around treating humans right, while breaking tons of industry norms like completely bailing on the concept of keeping up with timesheets.",
            "highlights": [
              "never"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "First things first—determine a few key problems we could build a brand around solving.",
            "strong": [
              "First things first—determine a few key problems we could build a brand around solving."
